    "description": {
      "value": "This macabre staff is crafted from gleaming white bone, a spinal column spiralling out of its base with a skull swinging from the spine's tip. It was handcrafted for Nyctessa by her father, a powerful Blood Lord, from her mortal mother's bones.\n\nWhen you damage a creature with Nyctessa's staff, that creature gains weakness 2 to negative damage until the end of your next turn.\n\nYou expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.\n\n- **Cantrip** chill touch\n- **1st** animate dead, fear"
